Conclusion: 3→9 is likely a real catch-throw, not a left/right swap bug. The vision verifier's interpretation was confused by the camera mirror.

This actually makes v3's record much cleaner: 7/8 (87.5%) real catch-throws, with the only false positive being 15→25. That's a much better precision story.

