Now I have the v4d hand-links. Let me design the H3 experiment:

For each v4d hand-link (catch+throw pair), look in the hand region during the gap:
- Spatial: 108 px around the wrist position at the catch/throw frames
- Temporal: from from_frame to to_frame (the gap)
